1
00:00:01,014 --> 00:00:02,424
Kyouma,

2
00:00:04,344 --> 00:00:05,044
I want...

3
00:00:06,174 --> 00:00:06,884
...you to be...

4
00:00:08,174 --> 00:00:09,344
...the messiah.

5
00:00:16,894 --> 00:00:19,394
You want me to be the messiah?

6
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:21,944
Ridiculous.

7
00:00:21,944 --> 00:00:24,364
I am a mad scientist...

8
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:27,074
I desire chaos and destruction!

9
00:00:33,244 --> 00:00:35,664
What happened to him?

10
00:00:40,914 --> 00:00:44,294
We will now restart Operation Urd.

11
00:00:45,044 --> 00:00:47,304
Mister Braun's still downstairs, man.

12
00:00:47,304 --> 00:00:47,924
I don't care!

13
00:00:47,924 --> 00:00:48,884
Wait!

14
00:00:48,884 --> 00:00:49,964
I told you.

15
00:00:50,424 --> 00:00:51,634
I'm against this.

16
00:00:51,634 --> 00:00:53,184
Against it?

17
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,554
This morning, you were helping me.

18
00:00:55,554 --> 00:00:57,354
This morning?

19
00:00:58,144 --> 00:01:00,144
Then... I knew it.

20
00:01:00,524 --> 00:01:01,644
Yes.

21
00:01:01,644 --> 00:01:03,444
The experiment took place.

22
00:01:03,444 --> 00:01:06,654
The D-mail has already changed the past.

23
00:01:06,984 --> 00:01:07,774
Seriously?

24
00:01:08,024 --> 00:01:10,744
The world line changed?

25
00:01:11,244 --> 00:01:12,364
Yes, I think so.

26
00:01:12,364 --> 00:01:13,824
Thus, you've lost some

27
00:01:13,824 --> 00:01:16,284
of your memories from before the change.

28
00:01:16,284 --> 00:01:19,664
Is this about that Lotto-6 thing?

29
00:01:19,664 --> 00:01:20,754
That's right.

30
00:01:21,584 --> 00:01:25,334
So why are you the only one who remembers?

31
00:01:26,424 --> 00:01:30,844
Titor told me that I have a power.

32
00:01:30,844 --> 00:01:35,344
To prove it, we need to move world lines again.

33
00:01:36,644 --> 00:01:37,604
A power?

34
00:01:38,264 --> 00:01:42,234
The power to retain memories, 
even across world line changes...

35
00:01:42,234 --> 00:01:45,234
The magic eye: Reading Steiner.

36
00:01:59,434 --> 00:02:05,104
Even the number of several billion heartbeats

